+# Only the server reads and writes it, to tell whether "anything actually changed this time".
+# The old `_on_crate_numbers_changed` resent the lights for **every** delivery area whenever a crate count changed,
+# and **both the true and false branches** of `set_indicator_light_rpc` **call `speaker_mechanism.play()`**
+# — 8 areas are 8 **different** speakers, so that really was 8 voices sounding at once, not the same one restarting.
+# Now it only broadcasts when the state actually flips.
+#
